          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Ruddry",
            text: _("I don’t know who you are, but you can’t continue down this road! There is a horde of those orcs bigger than any army I’ve ever seen just down the road!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("I’m Haldric; my father was King Eldaric IV in the lands northwest of here. Soldier, have you deserted your post?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Ruddry",
            text: _("No, Sir! I’m the sole survivor of the Clearwater Port expeditionary force. Trust me, you can’t continue down this road, Sir. Especially with the refugees, you’ll be slaughtered."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Tell me, does Clearwater Port still stand? Is the port free?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Ruddry",
            text: _("As far as I know, Sir. We have a large army, and they were pressing all able-bodied men and boys into service when I left. That orcish army is huge, but they haven’t met the main body of our forces yet."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("Well, we can’t go back, and the road ahead is blocked. I guess we’ll have to risk it and go through the Oldwood forest, then make a break for Clearwater Port."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Burin the Lost",
            portrait: "portraits/burin-annoyed.webp",
            text: _("Oh great, now a forest... I should have stayed at home and taken my chances with the orcs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Sir Ruddry",
            text: _("Sir, if you don’t mind, I’ll go with you."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lady Outlaw",
            text: _("On we go..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "last_done",
            value: "River",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_41",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prince Haldric",
            text: _("We have run out of time... We’ll be trapped in this swamp when winter arrives!"),
          },
        ],
      },
    ],
  },
]
